                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "7/10 - Time to cut.\n\nI really enjoy this game from the ability to put my swords together to make sparks to cutting things in half I hope to see it grow into something really fun.\n\nPersonally I wasn't a huge fan of the deflecting parts as at least for me there was no sound or indicator that energy blasts were coming at you so it felt sometimes like you just died.\n\nIt's a nice fun work out on survival mode but the game needs more depth to really shine.\n\nI hope this becomes a gem.",
